## Report

### 1. LLR-1103.1 — the single-task undo toast
- **Changed:** `taskboard/app.py:1468-1469` — added one `self.notify(f"Undone — {task.title} is back as it was.", title="Undo", severity="information", markup=False)` before `self.board.save()` in the single-task fall-through, covering both the field-restore and re-insert sub-paths. Cascade/milestones/migration branches and the stale-skip (`continue`) untouched.
- **Pinned literal:** `Undone — {task.title} is back as it was.`

### 2. LLR-1104.1 — the `?` help clips at word boundaries
- **Where the mid-word cut lived:** Textual's compositor wraps a height-1 `Label` inside the narrow right column with `break_long_words=True` — e.g. `the project under most pressure` painted `the project under m` (and dropped the rest). Not the Label's own width; the wrap happens at paint time against the column's 22 cells.
- **Changed:** `taskboard/modals.py` — added `_clip_words` (word-boundary clip + `…`, unbreakable token clips at edge) and a `_HelpLine(Label)` widget (subclasses `Label` so `query("Label")` still sees it, `width: 1fr` so `render()` reads the true column width). `HelpModal.compose` now renders legend meanings and usage bullets through `_HelpLine`. The example line/meaning are left as `Label`s (out of LLR-1104.1's stated scope — legend + usage).

### Tests
- `tests/test_undo_toast.py` — positive (pin via `t`, then `u`, toast equals pinned literal) and negative (purged task stays silent, only "Nothing to undo.") arms. RED on base: no toast.
- `tests/test_help_clip.py` — integration (every painted legend/usage line ends at `…` or a whole source, at 80×24) plus `_clip_words` unit pins (exact-edge, overlong-token, word-boundary, negative-control). RED on base: legend painted mid-word.

### Full suite
`2555 passed, 0 failed` in ~7:08. The 5 regressions my first draft caused (gantt help fit, gantt legend frame, kanban help copy, markup-census exemption) were fixed by making `_HelpLine` a `Label` subclass and leaving the example `Label(Text.from_markup(example))` untouched.

